                "conditions": [
                    {
                        "flag": "survey_fate",
                        "equals": "warned"
                    }
                ],
                "once": true,
                "text": "\"You're from up the valley,\" Dorcas Fenn says, without looking round from the shelf. \"We've had three conveyances in from Granary Row this fortnight. People sell quicker once they know. I don't think that's anybody's fault. I just thought somebody from there ought to be told it was filed.\"",
