                "once": true,
                "text": "\"Your objection,\" Dorcas Fenn says, coming down two rungs. \"It'll be bound with the quarter's minutes and come to me at the quarter's end. I've kept a space on the shelf.\" She taps it. \"Anybody may read it. That's what it's for. Mostly nobody does, which is not what it's for.\"",
