                        "not": {
                            "quest": "the_bound_minute"
                        }
                    }
                ],
                "text": "\"Your quarter's come down,\" Dorcas Fenn says, and comes down the ladder with a new volume under her arm, the boards still stiff. \"Bound this morning. Mrs Crale is prompt.\" She sets it on the reading desk and opens it at a ribbon. \"Item seven. Penny a page. Read anything, take nothing.\"",
