                        "quest": "the_bound_minute",
                        "status": "active"
                    }
                ],
                "text": "The bound volume is still on the reading desk with the ribbon in it. \"Nobody's moved it,\" Dorcas Fenn says. \"Nobody's read it either, but I'd not take that personally.\"",
                "choices": [
                    {
                        "label": "Read it.",
