                        "quest": "the_fenmoor_lot",
                        "status": "completed"
                    },
                    {
                        "flag": "armour_chain_fate",
                        "equals": "left"
                    }
                ],
                "text": "\"You left it with her,\" Dorcas Fenn says. It is not a question; somebody on the mud will have mentioned it, because somebody on the mud mentions everything. \"Good. Some paper's better where it is.\" She goes back up the ladder. \"Not much. Some.\"",
